  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation Team Europe for Digital Transformation in Mozambique &#xbf; promoting digital connectivity and services for universal access</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contract related to: Team Europe for Digital Transformation in Mozambique &#xbf; promoting digital connectivity and services for universal access - This Action complements the individual measure 2026 on strategic infrastructure investments with the European Investment Bank and Private operators. It aims to complement connectivity investments with soft measures that foster equitable and secure digital ecosystems, expand affordable access and enhance digital literacy. Notably through improved access to public services in rural and underserved areas, including the peripheries of relevant cities across the country, via the expansion of GovNet (the government network that provides online public services and information to citizens) and through skills development and entrepreneurship support enabled by the establishment and operationalization of CMCs (Multimedia Community Centres).</narrative>
  </description>
